From: spendollars <spendollars@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 15:14:32 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] @ feat(v3): on-chain agent passport API + indexer
 user-binding

- api-server: GET /api/v3/agents/by-tap/:tapId (passport by platform agent id)
  + GET /api/v3/agents (network registry); public read-only, V3_NETWORK_ENABLED-gated
- v3-network: getAgentByTapId / listNetworkAgents; bound_user_id (PII) dropped
  from public responses
- index: real resolveUserByWallet (agentic_wallets, multi-form, BIGINT-safe) +
  provisionAgentToOwner registry binding (secret-scrub behind V3_AUTO_SCRUB, default off)
- v3-minter: server-side minter (env-seed V3_MINTER_MNEMONIC, owner-gated deploy/mint)
@
